==Route to the final==
As the winners of the [[2023–24 UEFA Champions League]], [[Real Madrid CF|Real Madrid]] qualified directly for the final of the tournament.<ref name="Reuters-new cup" /> [[C.F. Pachuca|Pachuca]] advanced as the winners of the play-off match, known as the FIFA Challenger Cup, played on 14 December 2024.<ref>{{cite news |date=20 September 2024 |title=FIFA Intercontinental Cup: Key information |url=https://www.fifa.com/en/tournaments/mens/intercontinentalcup/2024/articles/information-tournament-details |work=[[FIFA]]|access-date=20 September 2024}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.fifa.com/en/tournaments/mens/intercontinentalcup/2024/articles/bureau-council-update |title=Bureau of the Council update on FIFA Intercontinental Cup 2024 |publisher=[[FIFA]] |date=19 September 2024 |access-date=21 September 2024}}</ref>

